on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  2] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  3] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  4] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  6] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  7] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  8] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  9] getglobal 22 ............................ <wreck>
  [ 11] getchunk ................................ <item 1 of wreck>
  [ 12] pushcons 0 .............................. <"found">
  [ 14] eq ...................................... <item 1 of wreck = "found">
  [ 15] jmpifz [ 28] ............................ if item 1 of wreck = "found" then / else
  [ 18] pushint8 15 ............................. <15>
  [ 20] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 21] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 23] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 15 to 0
  [ 25] jmp [ 36]
  [ 28] pushint8 15 ............................. <15>
  [ 30] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 32] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 34] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 15 to 1
  [ 36] ret
end
